 the fourth quarter [Technical Issues] streamlining of our saving process and travel efficiency of brands ended in the past year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/19/tripcom-group-ltd-tcom-q4-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"TCOM 2020 Q1","e":"tcom","d":"2020-05-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"James Jianzhang Liang","x":"For example, in the past two months, I've been spending one hour every week on live streaming platforms to promote our presale products, featuring attractive discounts and flexible cancellations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/29/tripcom-group-limited-tcom-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"TCOM 2020 Q1","e":"tcom","d":"2020-05-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"James Jianzhang Liang","x":"In addition to bookings, we have gained new customers, reactivated existing ones and increased exposure of our high-end products through the live streaming channels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/29/tripcom-group-limited-tcom-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"TCOM 2020 Q1","e":"tcom","d":"2020-05-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jane Jie Sun","x":"During this challenging time, we will work hard with our employees, customers, business partners and all stakeholders to streamline our organization and increase our efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/29/tripcom-group-limited-tcom-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"TCOM 2020 Q1","e":"tcom","d":"2020-05-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Cindy Xiaofan Wang","x":"Cost saving in product development in the first quarter was mainly driven by a decrease of performance-based bonus due to the pandemic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/29/tripcom-group-limited-tcom-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"TCOM 2020 Q2","e":"tcom","d":"2020-09-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"James Jianzhang Liang","x":"As part of the new campaign to relaunch travel activities in both China and abroad, we utilized live streaming to reconnect with our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/09/25/tripcom-group-limited-tcom-q2-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"TCOM 2020 Q2","e":"tcom","d":"2020-09-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"James Jianzhang Liang","x":"So far, we have completed dozens of live streaming shows covering most of China's top destinations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/09/25/tripcom-group-limited-tcom-q2-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"TCOM 2020 Q3","e":"tcom","d":"2020-12-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Cindy Xiaofan Wang","x":"The year-over-year decline was mainly due to a reversal of bad debt provision for our travel suppliers, offset partially by personnel restructuring costs related to certain overseas subsidiaries.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/02/tripcom-group-limited-tcom-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"TCOM 2020 Q3","e":"tcom","d":"2020-12-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Alex Poon","x":"And also considering the competition and some of the cost savings could reverse and also the user acquisition -- new user acquisition strategy not only in Tier 1, 2 cities, but also lower-tier cities?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/02/tripcom-group-limited-tcom-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"TCOM 2020 Q4","e":"tcom","d":"2021-03-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jane-Jie-Sun","x":"And as we explained, starting from last year, we did noticed that the content as well as the -- the content including the, for example the live streaming as well as the fresh sales significantly helped us to improve our conversion rate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/04/tripcom-group-limited-tcom-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"TCOM 2020 Q4","e":"tcom","d":"2021-03-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jane-Jie-Sun","x":"Our live streaming and the special deals channels have become the go-to platform for travelers that seek value for money deals.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/04/tripcom-group-limited-tcom-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"TCOM 2020 Q4","e":"tcom","d":"2021-03-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Gong","x":"So we have done a lot of, in low cost saving measures in secondary [Indecipherable] which are also reflected in our financials.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/04/tripcom-group-limited-tcom-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"TCOM 2021 Q1","e":"tcom","d":"2021-05-19","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"James Jianzhang Liang","x":"By hosting more comprehensive travel content such as live streaming, enhance information feeds and short videos, we are able to ignite greater interest in travel and facilitates new trends such as significant increase in short distance travels and trips to long-haul destinations in the past year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/19/tripcom-group-limited-tcom-q1-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"TCOM 2021 Q1","e":"tcom","d":"2021-05-19","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jane-Jie-Sun","x":"Hundreds of live events were streamlined in April and DAU for the live streaming section app doubled months over months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/19/tripcom-group-limited-tcom-q1-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"TCOM 2021 Q2","e":"tcom","d":"2021-09-24","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jane Jie Sun","x":"We continue to reinforce our infrastructure and output of our first-class live streaming and promotion capabilities for travel industry.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/09/24/tripcom-group-ltd-tcom-q2-2021-earnings-call-trans/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[39,1,5575,0,0,0,4343,946],[40,1,6453,0,0,0,5460,701],[41,1,6081,0,0,0,4971,789],[42,1,5660,0,0,0,4537,775],[43,1,5381,0,0,0,4428,664],[44,1,6108,